      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "During class, the teacher asked Little Ming to answer a question."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明小声地说：“我……我不会。”",
      "traditional": "小明小聲地說：“我……我不會。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎo shēng de shuō wǒ wǒ bú huì",
