      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming said in a soft voice: “I... I can't.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老师说：“小明，太小声了，一点儿也不像男子汉!”",
      "traditional": "老師說：“小明，太小聲了，一點兒也不像男子漢!”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī shuō xiǎo míng tài xiǎo shēng le yì diǎn'r yě bú xiàng nán zǐ hàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher said: “Little Ming, your voice is too quiet. You're not manly at all!”"
    },
    {
